le", "time": 6527.109, "timestamp": "01:48:47", "text": "买个钱包，买个也有……的钱包"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6529.35, "timestamp": "01:48:49", "text": "零钱袋。你可以直接把硬币放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6531.189, "timestamp": "01:48:51", "text": "里面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6533.35, "timestamp": "01:48:53", "text": "嗯。是的。或者，如果您是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6534.79, "timestamp": "01:48:54", "text": "携带类似手提袋或小包的袋子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6536.31, "timestamp": "01:48:56", "text": "某个地方有硬币区域"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6538.709, "timestamp": "01:48:58", "text": "因为你会获得大量的金币"}]